  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Kujong (Couillon). Logic: Partnership trick-taking with 24-card deck. Key: 21-point threshold to score, Kapot (all tricks) = bonus.',
    Player: 'Kujong is a Belgian trick-taking game for 4 players in partnerships. 24-card deck (A-K-Q-J-10-9). Ace=4, King=3, Queen=2, Jack=1. Turned card sets trump. Must win 21 of 40 points to erase a branch from your score tree. First team to erase all branches wins.',
    objective: "Win more points in tricks than the other team to 'erase' a branch from your score tree.",
    gameplay: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card (or Trump).\n2. Highest Trump wins, or highest card of the led suit.\n3. **Points**: Trick capture is based on rank (A-K-Q-J-10-9). Point cards in the entire deck total 40.',
